---
import LegalLayout from '@/layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Contact Us – Feedback & Support | SRTConverters"
  description="Get in touch with the SRTConverters.com team. Send your feedback, bug reports, feature suggestions, or general inquiries."
  canonicalUrl="https://srtconverters.com/contact/"
  pageTitle="Contact Us"
>
  <p>
    Have a question, feedback, or need help with one of our subtitle conversion tools? We would love to hear from you.
  </p>
  <p>
    SRTConverters.com is built to provide fast, reliable, and accessible subtitle tools for creators worldwide. Your feedback helps us continuously improve our algorithms, format support, and user experience.
  </p>

  <div style="background-color: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 1.5rem; margin: 2rem 0;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 0; color: var(--text-primary);">Direct Email Contact</h2>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">
      You can reach out directly via email at:
    </p>
    <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
      <a href="mailto:contact@srtconverters.com" style="color: var(--accent-primary); text-decoration: underline;">
        contact@srtconverters.com
      </a>
    </p>
    <p style="font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 0;">
      We do our best to review and respond to inquiries within 24–48 business hours.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2>What You Can Contact Us About</h2>
  
  <h3>1. Bug Reports & Conversion Issues</h3>
  <p>
    If you encountered an issue while converting a file (for example, unusual character encoding, timing issues, or formatting errors), please let us know!
  </p>
  <p>
    To help us investigate and fix the problem quickly, please consider including:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Which tool you were using (e.g., TXT to SRT, SRT to Text, etc.).</li>
    <li>Your browser and device (e.g., Chrome on Windows 11, Safari on macOS, iPhone).</li>
    <li>A brief description or small sample snippet of the text/file that caused the issue.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>2. Feature Suggestions & New Tools</h3>
  <p>
    Looking for a specific subtitle format converter (such as ASS, SSA, or SBV) or a new timing setting? We actively review user requests to prioritize future tool development.
  </p>

  <h3>3. Privacy & Compliance Questions</h3>
  <p>
    If you have questions regarding our 100% browser-based processing, data handling, or compliance policies, our team is happy to provide clarification.
  </p>

  <h3>4. General Inquiries & Partnerships</h3>
  <p>
    For any other questions, feedback, or general inquiries about SRTConverters.com, please don't hesitate to reach out.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
